$ outside $D.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350800 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350801 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350802 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350803 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350804 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1041 "selection" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1104 #edb/ref 17592186350800 13194139535470 true] [17592186350799 1110 #uuid "54de2e7b-2daf-56ed-90fd-68fe64149745" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350800 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350800 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535470 true] [17592186350800 1111 #uuid "041d12b6-c95e-50e3-887f-75f323d28919" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350801 1034 "I and III only" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350801 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535470 true] [17592186350801 1111 #uuid "37a5d384-cda8-5db1-ba5d-5ce342db1ff6" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350802 1034 "III only" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350802 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535470 true] [17592186350802 1111 #uuid "753f5067-1d29-594c-96e7-7cee22bd8670" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350803 1034 "I and II only" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350803 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535470 true] [17592186350803 1111 #uuid "e04b7443-1b94-59f9-8b54-613545626f00" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350804 1034 "II only" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350804 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535470 true] [17592186350804 1111 #uuid "68028880-9ac2-51a1-bc89-6d548a2368dc" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350805 1017 #edb/ref 17592186350806 13194139535470 true] [17592186350805 1089 "q-129909" 13194139535470 true] [17592186350805 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535470 true] [17592186350805 1100 "Let $D$ be a finite region enclosed by the curves